{"5100510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Heart Harvest: A Detective Game","steam_appid":5100510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/6857f3598e668c6b2660104a41a76dc5.webp?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=35 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/c19cdc4f6cc7617ad40a8050293f5631.apng?t=1793721753\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/c19cdc4f6cc7617ad40a8050293f5631.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" class=\"bb_img\" width=770 height=275 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur, a young detective who as a child lost his mother to a murderous father. But police lacked the evidence to charge the father with homicide. Now with your newfound skills you are working to solve murder cases so that you may find justice for others.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/3c0cb16efbf993df677a743137d4cbee.webp?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=43 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" width=924 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.webm?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.mp4?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something eerie about these cases, a pungent vanilla scent, victims with their heart torn out of their chest.. Unveil the horror that binds the murders. Will you catch the horrifying harvester? Or will it harvest you first?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/b84f66f0a1e20f0661d6404df7cda8b3.avif?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=98 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" width=924 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.webm?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.mp4?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to open that hatch? To look into that dark air vent? To peer into the cracks in the walls? You will need a strong mental fortitude to solve the murder cases of the heart harvested victims.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must answer the investigation questions for each murder scene, there is no hand holding, you must find the clues, question the suspects and piece together the evidence yourself. Make notes in your police note book or use some pen and paper! Once you believe you have all the answers to the chief's questions, hand in your evidence and report back to the chief to go over your findings together.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/6857f3598e668c6b2660104a41a76dc5.webp?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=35 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/c19cdc4f6cc7617ad40a8050293f5631.apng?t=1793721753\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/c19cdc4f6cc7617ad40a8050293f5631.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" class=\"bb_img\" width=770 height=275 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Arthur, a young detective who as a child lost his mother to a murderous father. But police lacked the evidence to charge the father with homicide. Now with your newfound skills you are working to solve murder cases so that you may find justice for others.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/3c0cb16efbf993df677a743137d4cbee.webp?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=43 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" width=924 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.webm?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/83022a9555350fdccf4de3519395820e.mp4?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something eerie about these cases, a pungent vanilla scent, victims with their heart torn out of their chest.. Unveil the horror that binds the murders. Will you catch the horrifying harvester? Or will it harvest you first?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/b84f66f0a1e20f0661d6404df7cda8b3.avif?t=1793721753\" width=780 height=98 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.poster.avif?t=1793721753\" width=924 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.webm?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/extras\/8f46fe5bc0a5d3a6864f0a97022e8380.mp4?t=1793721753\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you dare to open that hatch? To look into that dark air vent? To peer into the cracks in the walls? You will need a strong mental fortitude to solve the murder cases of the heart harvested victims.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must answer the investigation questions for each murder scene, there is no hand holding, you must find the clues, question the suspects and piece together the evidence yourself. Make notes in your police note book or use some pen and paper! Once you believe you have all the answers to the chief's questions, hand in your evidence and report back to the chief to go over your findings together.<\/p>","short_description":"Passionate murders. Ripped out hearts. And something crawling within the walls. Find clues, gather the evidence and connect the dots in this point and click detective thriller game. Solve each murder and uncover the horror linking them all..","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/493bd3bd7923686edaedf5e8667f438f708b25eb\/header.jpg?t=1793721753","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/7e73f93c16ce48699622ef211fb177e903a77f54\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721753","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5100510\/7e73f93c16ce48699622ef211fb177e903a77f54\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721753","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 3rd Gen i3\/AMD FX-4100 Series<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD (Integrated), GeForce 6 Series\/Radeon R7 Series<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Thorn Spire Games"],"publishers":["Thorn Spire Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1199,"final":959,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$11.99","final_formatted":"$9.59"},"packages":[1766980],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Heart Harvest: A Detective Game","description":"","selection_text":"Se